 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Tent poles give biggest clue. They usually want go where they don't interfere with each other. That's a good spot for stability, keeping the tent dry. A small hill also helps drain water. Don't panic. You can still use it, just peg it down harder. Keep the tent as far away as possible, fire can quickly spread in the wind. That's it. Now think about your exit. You don't want be in the middle of tent when you want get out.",
